# Verity

This repository is being prepared for controlled publication of sanitized,
history-free source snapshots. See the [snapshot import process](docs/snapshot-import.md)
for its security and ownership boundaries.

Contributions are described in [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md). Please report
vulnerabilities according to [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md).

Verity is licensed under the [Apache License 2.0](LICENSE).
